From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 19:35:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Play keybox: per-user import, switch and leaf re-signing

KeyboxActivity (SHOW_UI protected) imports a user-supplied keybox, turns its use on or off (off by
default, only with sandboxed Play services installed and a currently valid chain) and deletes it.
KeyboxStore keeps the validated XML as 0600 files in this user's no-backup storage; a rejected
import changes nothing, and the keybox is deleted when Play services is fully removed.
BinderGms2Gca.rewriteAttestationChain accepts only Play services' UID (an inert GSF sibling from
upgraded installs aside). Nothing is bundled, downloaded or logged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
